<title>POLAND: KGHM Q2 net rises to PLN 148.5 mln.</title>
<headline>KGHM Q2 net rises to PLN 148.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>KGHM preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		   325.47   vs  142.31</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit		     325.80   vs  152.54</p>
<p>    net profit			   148.48   vs   69.36</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: KGHM Polska Miedz SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			  1,106.33   vs  840.83</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     663.48   vs  598.40</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.22   vs    2.43</p>
<p>    income tax			   151.70   vs   70.95</p>
<p>    other taxes			   25.62   vs   12.24</p>
<p>    financial revenues		 111.17   vs   87.20</p>
<p>    financial costs		    110.62   vs   74.53</p>
<p>    investment			   131.90   vs   93.04</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		   565.33   vs  373.97</p>
